  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W45",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周纯绿孳巢蜥继续占据高分环境榜首，占比16.3%，拿下18个八强和三个冠军。蓝白吟颂也席卷三场。整个环境构筑变化不大。",
          "en": "Mono-Green Broodscale Combo again led the high-score field at 16.3%, with 18 Top 8 spots and three wins. Azorius Chant Control won three events as well. Deck construction across the field has shifted little."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "一套把[[card:Persist|留存]]掘坟和[[card:Splinter Twin|分裂双身]]思路放在一起的格利极双身拿下八强：deck:e854af6d20f671780391。组合技组件满编FRA[[card:Divining Duelist|卜命斗客]]，既能配合双身无限造人，也能滤牌把统领送进坟场，法术师类别还能配合[[card:Flame of Anor|阿诺尔之火]]。",
          "en": "A Grixis Twin list pairing [[card:Persist|Persist]] reanimation with [[card:Splinter Twin|Splinter Twin]] made the Top 8 at deck:e854af6d20f671780391. It runs four copies of [[card:Divining Duelist|Divining Duelist]] from Reality Fracture. The Duelist can make unlimited tokens with [[card:Splinter Twin|Splinter Twin]] or filter draws and put [[card:Archon of Cruelty|Archon of Cruelty]] in the graveyard. It is also a Wizard for [[card:Flame of Anor|Flame of Anor]]."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:e854af6d20f671780391",
            "label": {
              "zh": "格利极双身 · onlybrews · 第8名",
              "en": "Grixis Twin · onlybrews · Rank 8"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "grixis-twin",
              "display_name": "Grixis Twin",
              "event_id": "12857413",
              "deck_id": "e854af6d20f671780391",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "3867322d86d332286153fa5a69d944a25bfcf31008a2bed02933c7b5854c5ef2",
              "player": "onlybrews",
              "final_rank": 8,
              "starttime": "2026-11-02 15:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "另外一套类似红黑躁狂构筑的格利极节奏拿下四强：deck:a4aca578072a5bd500ab。去掉[[card:Fear of Missing Out|患失惧影]]，换成四张[[card:Psychic Frog|灵能蛙]]，再带两张[[card:Kaito, Bane of Nightmares|梦魇克星魁渡]]。[[card:Dark Matter Manipulator|暗物质操弄师]]、[[card:Moonshadow|蔽月影]]和[[card:Nethergoyf|阴间耶夫]]仍然满编，主体还是原来的低费威胁和坟场体系。[[card:Psychic Frog|灵能蛙]]和魁渡确实也都非常适配这个思路。",
          "en": "A Grixis Tempo list borrowing from Rakdos Delirium made the Top 4 at deck:a4aca578072a5bd500ab. It trades [[card:Fear of Missing Out|Fear of Missing Out]] for four copies of [[card:Psychic Frog|Psychic Frog]] and adds two copies of [[card:Kaito, Bane of Nightmares|Kaito, Bane of Nightmares]]. Four each of [[card:Dark Matter Manipulator|Dark Matter Manipulator]], [[card:Moonshadow|Moonshadow]], and [[card:Nethergoyf|Nethergoyf]] preserve the cheap-threat and graveyard plan. Both [[card:Psychic Frog|Psychic Frog]] and Kaito fit that plan well."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:a4aca578072a5bd500ab",
            "label": {
              "zh": "格利极节奏 · manohito · 第4名",
              "en": "Grixis Tempo · manohito · Rank 4"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "grixis-tempo",
              "display_name": "Grixis Tempo",
              "event_id": "12857682",
              "deck_id": "a4aca578072a5bd500ab",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "9437f09e519cc49f17d661f69c59ac5bde7475a44eabc9a6bef1f741ed3a4e6a",
              "player": "manohito",
              "final_rank": 4,
              "starttime": "2026-11-07 02:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "text": {
          "zh": "还有一套非常传统的勇得中速（无Saga）拿下一个四强：deck:3fb6d4e0265438db1869。简直朴实得让人不敢相信。",
          "en": "A remarkably traditional Jund Midrange list also made the Top 4 at deck:3fb6d4e0265438db1869. It leaves out [[card:Urza's Saga|Urza's Saga]]. It’s almost hard to believe how straightforward this list is."
        },
        "deck_links": [
